    "view": {
      "value": "<div class=\"contentLayout2\"><style>[data-colorid=i325z9ssf0]{color:#4d4d4d} html[data-color-mode=dark] [data-colorid=i325z9ssf0]{color:#b2b2b2}[data-colorid=emofrhn7ns]{color:#4d4d4d} html[data-color-mode=dark] [data-colorid=emofrhn7ns]{color:#b2b2b2}</style>\n<div class=\"columnLayout two-right-sidebar\" data-layout=\"two-right-sidebar\">\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<h2 id=\"DrugOrder/TreatmentDetailsControl-Purpose\">Purpose</h2><p>This control can be configured to view the drug order details (prescription details) for a particular patient.</p><h2 id=\"DrugOrder/TreatmentDetailsControl-Screenshot\">Screenshot</h2><p><em><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><br /><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" alt=\"Drug Order Details control\" width=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/98402409/Screen%20Shot%202016-06-28%20at%2010.26.54%20AM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1479103913484&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=600&amp;height=126\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/98402409/Screen%20Shot%202016-06-28%20at%2010.26.54%20AM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1479103913484&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"98402404\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Screen Shot 2016-06-28 at 10.26.54 AM.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"98402409\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"13\" data-media-id=\"c9059b09-5967-486b-af5a-dd5656ed0057\" data-media-type=\"file\" title=\"Drug Order Details control\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/98402409/Screen%20Shot%202016-06-28%20at%2010.26.54%20AM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1479103913484&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1200&amp;height=252 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/98402409/Screen%20Shot%202016-06-28%20at%2010.26.54%20AM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1479103913484&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=600&amp;height=126 1x\" /></span></span><br /></em></p><h2 id=\"DrugOrder/TreatmentDetailsControl-Configuration\">Configuration</h2><h3 id=\"DrugOrder/TreatmentDetailsControl-SampleConfig\">Sample Config</h3><div><div class=\"syntaxhighlighter sh-confluence js\"><p><br /></p><div class=\"code panel pdl conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"4f349acb-5d55-4198-944a-ed7ee18498ac\" data-macro-name=\"code\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeHeader panelHeader pdl\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;\"><b>Add to clinical/dashboard.json for it to appear on the patient dashboard</b></div><div class=\"codeContent panelContent pdl\">\n<pre class=\"syntaxhighlighter-pre\" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=\"brush: js; gutter: false; theme: Confluence\" data-theme=\"Confluence\">&quot;treatmentsDetails&quot;: {\n    &quot;title&quot;:&quot;Treatments Details&quot;,\n    &quot;translationKey&quot; : &quot;DASHBOARD_TITLE_TREATMENT_DETAIL&quot;,\n    &quot;type&quot;: &quot;drugOrderDetails&quot;,\n    &quot;displayOrder&quot;: 3,\n    &quot;dashboardConfig&quot;: {\n    &quot;showOnlyActive&quot;:true,                     \n    &quot;drugConceptSet&quot;: &quot;All TB Drugs&quot;,\n    &quot;showDetailsButton&quot;: true\n   }\n}</pre>\n</div></div><p><br /></p><h3 id=\"DrugOrder/TreatmentDetailsControl-KeyFieldTable\">Key Field Table</h3></div></div><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"wrapped confluenceTable\"><colgroup><col /><col /><col /></colgroup><thead><tr><th class=\"confluenceTh\"><div class=\"tablesorter-header-inner\">Key</div></th><th class=\"confluenceTh\"><div class=\"tablesorter-header-inner\">Info</div></th><th colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTh\"><div class=\"tablesorter-header-inner\">Mandatory</div></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class=\"confluenceTd\">title</td><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><p>Indicates the title that will be displayed on the dashboard for the section</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\">Y</td></tr><tr><td class=\"confluenceTd\">type</td><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><div class=\"content-wrapper\"><p>type of the section or control.</p><p><strong>type should be &quot;drugOrderDetails&quot;</strong></p></div></td><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\">Y</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\">drugConceptSet</td><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\">Drug orders will be filtered upon the concepts specified as part of this concept set. If not specified, it will display all drug orders.</td><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\">N</td></tr><tr><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><p>dashboardConfig</p></td><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><p><span data-colorid=\"i325z9ssf0\">Indicates the configuration for the patient dashboard</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\">Y</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\">showOnlyActive</td><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\"><div class=\"content-wrapper\"><p>Determines if to display only active drug orders or not. Possible values are true or false.</p><ul><li><span>Set this to &quot;true&quot; to display only active drug orders.</span></li><li class=\"auto-cursor-target\">If &quot;false&quot; or not configured, will show all the drugs</li></ul></div></td><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\">N</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\">showDetailsButton</td><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\"><span data-colorid=\"emofrhn7ns\">Configuration to display audit information when arrow sign is clicked. If set to false, the arrow button will not be displayed.</span></td><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\">N</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cell aside\" data-type=\"aside\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-tip conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"9e21e6bc-65b4-4f30-a341-0dc091c2e859\" data-macro-name=\"tip\"><p class=\"title\">On this Page</p><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-approve confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p> </p><div class=\"toc-macro client-side-toc-macro  conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-headerelements=\"H1,H2,H3,H4,H5,H6,H7\" data-macro-id=\"c600f8c4-b8b4-4eb8-bd41-e903ed368a03\" data-macro-name=\"toc\"> </div><p> </p></div></div><div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"11c594ed-5883-4869-a352-0f4f6562d86e\" data-macro-name=\"panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelHeader\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;background-color: #1FA5A0;color: White;\"><b>Related Display Controls</b></div><div class=\"panelContent\">\n<p> </p><ul class=\"childpages-macro conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-macro-id=\"de12be85-d772-4bad-93f7-a404f07e5146\" data-macro-name=\"children\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/114207300/Chronic+Treatment+Chart+Control\" data-linked-resource-id=\"114207300\" data-linked-resource-version=\"12\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Chronic Treatment Chart Control</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/98402409/Drug+Order+Treatment+Details+Control\" data-linked-resource-id=\"98402409\" data-linked-resource-version=\"13\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Drug Order / Treatment Details Control</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/99123216/Treatment+Display+Control\" data-linked-resource-id=\"99123216\" data-linked-resource-version=\"20\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Treatment Display Control</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/114746475/Treatment+Details+Control\" data-linked-resource-id=\"114746475\" data-linked-resource-version=\"2\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Treatment Details Control</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/3152838666/Sending+prescription+to+patients\" data-linked-resource-id=\"3152838666\" data-linked-resource-version=\"8\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Sending prescription to patients</a></li></ul><p> </p>\n</div></div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
